[[File:Sunlit bracers detail.png|130px|left]]
The '''sunlit bracers''' are gloves that were rewarded when completing all column six tasks in [[Grid Master]]. The bracers have a [[passive effect]] which doubles any base healing received, including from the [[amulet of blood fury]], [[blood spells]], and [[Guthan the Infested's equipment]], but doesn't double modifiers like [[bloodbark armour]]. They will protect the wearer from [[nettles]].

